One step of the filter runs. What does this code print?

```
float aci = 10.0;
float hiz = 20.0;        // °/s
float dt = 0.01;         // s
float ivmeAci = 12.0;
aci = 0.98 * (aci + hiz * dt) + 0.02 * ivmeAci;
Serial.println(aci, 2);
```

